<http://data.silknow.org/object/94e2c3d9-9c12-3748-88a3-001ed3a31ce9/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Furnishing fabric of Jacquard woven silk. The red satin ground is covered with small stylised flower heads. Superimposed on these, woven in yellow and bound in twill, is a bold design of clusters of three dahlias surrounded by leaves. Between these clusters, also in yellow, are three butterflies centred on a stylised flower head in the Japanese style."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/94e2c3d9-9c12-3748-88a3-001ed3a31ce9> .

